    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Perfectly positioned in the heart of Dublin's vibrant Liberties, 12 Brabazon Square is a charming two-bedroom home offering an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers or , seeking a centrally located property with private outdoor space and parking.\r\n\r\nCombining period character with modern conveniences, this compact home features high ceilings, an open fireplace, fitted storage throughout, and a bright south-facing rear yard, all set in a beautiful square within easy reach of a host of amenities.\r\n\r\nThe Liberties is one of Dublin's most sought-after and historic neighbourhoods, renowned for its unique blend of heritage, culture, and modern city living. Residents enjoy immediate access to Newmarket Square, Digital Hub, St. Stephen's Green, excellent cafés, restaurants, shops and local amenities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, making commuting throughout Dublin simple and convenient."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway                               1.28m * .96m\r\nShelving. Laminate wood floor. Alarm panel.\r\n\r\nLiving room/ Kitchen       4.3m * 2.93m\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in shelving and storage. Open fire with tiled surround. High ceilings. Fully fitted floor units with solid oak worktops. Electric hob and oven. Stainless steel sink unit. Laminate splashback. Integrated fridge. Integrated dishwasher.\r\n\r\nRear Hall                             1.47m * .74m\r\n\r\nTiled floor. Velux windows. Built in storage.\r\n\r\nBathroom                           2.71m * 1.45m\r\n\r\nTiled floor. Tiled walls. Wash hand basin. WC.  Bath with thermostatic shower. Storage plumbed for washing machine. Fitted chrome shelving. Doors to garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom                             2.63m * 1.91m\r\n\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in shelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom                             2.15m * 1.77m\r\n\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in shelving.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nRear Yard                            2.46m * 1.7m\r\n\r\nConcrete. Southerly aspect.\r\n\r\nParking to front."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Dublin 8 location\r\nTwo-bedroom home\r\nOpen-plan living accommodation\r\nHigh ceilings\r\nSolid oak worktops\r\nIntegrated appliances\r\nBuilt-in storage throughout\r\nFully tiled bathroom\r\nSouth-facing private rear yard\r\nParking to the front\r\nWalking distance to Dublin City Centre"
      },
      {
